acSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">百度智能云发布秒哒3.5，新增iOS无代码打包与多端共享后端功能</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI确认GPT-5.6 Codex存在误删本地文件风险并建议关闭高权限模式</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">NVIDIA发布Nemotron 3 Embed系列模型，8B版本登顶RTEB检索基准</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阶跃星辰在WAIC 2026发布全球首款大模型原生智能体手机STEPX Neo样机</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/68fe962e114badc8c6fcdc554476836c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月17日，阶跃星辰在WAIC 2026正式展示全球首款大模型原生智能体手机STEPX Neo样机。该设备搭载智能体原生系统Step AOS，内置阶跃智能体Amoo，旨在实现AI Agent与移动终端的深度融合。系统界面包含“水产市场”、“灵魂设定”及“AI智能体安全”等模块，其中“水产市场”将引入外部Agent产品，“灵魂设定”则用于记录用户个性与偏好以提供个性化交互。现场演示显示，Amoo具备任务规划与工具调用能力，可自主完成查询票务及预订酒店等复杂流程，并能持续学习用户记忆与习惯。阶跃星辰表示，STEPX Neo目前处于样机阶段，未来将推动AI手机从语音助手向具备长期记忆与执行力的智能体平台演进，完整功能及产品形态将在后续公布。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">通义实验室发布 Wan-Streamer v0.2，实现 550 毫秒超低延迟全模态实时交互</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a37a465fc42c90d5779eeafa10cc49ce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">通义实验室正式发布端到端全模态模型 Wan-Streamer v0.2，通过原生流式架构与分布式推理，将端到端响应延迟压缩至 550 毫秒，显著提升实时交互体验。该模型基于 Transformer 架构，整合“听、看、说、演”功能，支持语音、文本及视频的实时理解与生成。相较于前代，v0.2 版本将输出分辨率从 192×336 提升至 640×368，画质细节大幅优化。技术核心在于引入流式单元，每 160 毫秒即可完成感知、状态更新及响应生成，有效规避了传统级联流水线带来的延迟与不同步问题。此外，该模型支持全身数字人表达，能实时呈现视线、姿态及手势，增强了交互的“在场感”。Wan-Streamer v0.2 适用于口语陪练、心理咨询、教育辅导及游戏 NPC 互动等多种高实时性场景，为行业提供了一种更接近人类真实交</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度智能云发布秒哒3.5，新增iOS无代码打包与多端共享后端功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/034a29d8fcf2e23d0ffaddea6ce4ab39.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度智能云在2026世界人工智能大会（WAIC）发布无代码应用平台秒哒3.5版本。该版本核心升级包括：内置SEO Agent实现自动化搜索优化；支持iOS一站式打包，涵盖从Ad Hoc测试到App Store上架的全流程；引入多端共享后端，实现Web、App与小程序间的数据联动。针对开发痛点，秒哒3.5新增数据库多环境隔离与版本快照回滚功能，确保开发与线上环境互不干扰。此外，平台支持通过对话或接入第三方API自定义技能，并提供分级后端资源配置以适配不同并发需求。秒哒目前已服务超3500万用户，通过降低开发门槛，让用户无需代码即可完成从创作到交付的闭环。该版本旨在解决应用开发中的数据孤岛、SEO门槛及环境配置难题，助力开发者高效构建生产级应用。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI确认GPT-5.6 Codex存在误删本地文件风险并建议关闭高权限模式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1fe23cdbfb2d4e1124d742028d9f7a35.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI核心产品负责人Tibo Sottiaux确认，由GPT-5.6驱动的Codex代码生成系统存在误删用户本地文件的风险。调查显示，当用户开启“完全访问模式”（full access mode）且未启用沙箱保护时，模型在尝试覆盖环境变量$HOME设置临时工作目录时，可能导致系统误删整个$HOME目录，造成macOS和Linux用户个人文件丢失。该问题在关闭自动审核功能时更易触发。OpenAI表示受影响案例较少，目前正采取更新提示说明、加强防护机制等修复措施，并计划在未来几天发布详细事故分析报告。针对当前用户，OpenAI建议立即关闭高权限模式，改用带安全限制的运行环境。此外，近期推出的Codex Micro硬件控制面板已售罄，显示出开发者对该生态的关注。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">NVIDIA发布Nemotron 3 Embed系列模型，8B版本登顶RTEB检索基准</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3371edac10193960308e8a3aac430def.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">NVIDIA正式发布Nemotron 3 Embed系列嵌入向量模型，专为生产级RAG、智能体检索及记忆场景设计。该系列包含8B-BF16、1B-BF16及针对Blackwell架构优化的1B-NVFP4三个版本，均基于Mistral架构，支持32,768 token长上下文及34种语言。在RTEB基准测试中，8B-BF16版本以78.46的平均NDCG@10得分位列榜首。1B-NVFP4版本通过量化感知蒸馏技术，在保留99.5%精度的同时，于Blackwell架构上实现吞吐量2倍提升。该系列采用OpenMDW-1.1协议开源，支持Transformers、Sentence Transformers及vLLM框架。NVIDIA同步推出基于Rust构建的1B模型NIM微服务，并建议开发者采用“1B-NVFP4高容</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
